# JustAC hand pin, WoW Forever: Holy Paladin damage while there is nothing to heal. The sim
# list source (tools/forever-apl-src) models no healer. Order: Wowhead's Forever level-30
# healer overview (Documentation/forever-guides/paladin-priest.md, Paladin - Holy).
# Supported conditions: target.health.pct<N, [!]dot.X.ticking, active_enemies>=N.

actions=judgement
actions+=/holy_strike
# Only usable against undead and demons; usability filters it elsewhere.
actions+=/exorcism
actions+=/holy_shock
actions+=/consecration,if=active_enemies>=2
